From ac58442e7c0e6f1cc4c25b52903bd94b0c559c00 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: obaidr1 <147771377+obaidr1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 09:52:58 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 09/10] F4 inspector: F5 freezes the picture to inspect and
 mark objects

With the inspector on, F5 stops the game on its current picture. The mouse
keeps picking objects, the wheel / Tab / PageUp / PageDown step through
everything stacked under the pointer, a click (or Enter / Space) marks or
unmarks one, drawn with a yellow frame, and every mark with its position,
page, palette and HD replacement (or SD) is written to texture_marks.txt.
F5 or Esc goes on, F4 ends it. debug_overlay takes pause / cycle / mark.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
